<Border xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Tag="FullBleedBriefing" BorderBrush="#92968C" BorderThickness="1" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
  <Border.Resources>
    <Style TargetType="{x:Type TextBlock}">
      <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="/Assets/Resources/ui/fonts/#Special Elite"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#49677F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="18"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Normal"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="24"/>
      <Setter Property="LineStackingStrategy" Value="BlockLineHeight"/>
    </Style>
  </Border.Resources>
  <Border.Background>
    <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="1,0.8">
      <GradientStop Color="#DADCD5" Offset="0"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#F0F0E8" Offset="0.32"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#E7E9E2" Offset="0.76"/>
      <GradientStop Color="#D4D8D1" Offset="1"/>
    </LinearGradientBrush>
  </Border.Background>
  <Grid>
    <Canvas IsHitTestVisible="False" ClipToBounds="True">
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="39" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#9A9F94" StrokeThickness="1" Data="M 18,39 L 14,28 15,14 11,2"/>
      <Ellipse Canvas.Left="13" Canvas.Top="76" Width="10" Height="13" Fill="#616456"/>
      <Path Stroke="#D3D6CA" StrokeThickness="1.5" Data="M 13,83 C 14,89 20,90 24,85"/>
    </Canvas>
    <Border Width="2" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.09" HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Width="1" Background="#FFFFFF" Opacity="0.32" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="4,0,0,0" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <Border Height="1" Background="#9A9F94" Opacity="0.12" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"/>
    <StackPanel Margin="38,30,28,30">
      <Border BorderBrush="#A24F4E" BorderThickness="1.5" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,5,26"
              HorizontalAlignment="Right" Opacity="0.8" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
        <Border.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="-2"/></Border.RenderTransform>
        <Border.OpacityMask>
          <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0.2,1">
            <GradientStop Color="#E0000000" Offset="0"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#B0000000" Offset="0.32"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#F0000000" Offset="0.35"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#B0000000" Offset="0.71"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#E0000000" Offset="1"/>
          </LinearGradientBrush>
        </Border.OpacityMask>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="SECRET" TextAlignment="Center" Foreground="#A24F4E" FontSize="20"/>
          <TextBlock Text="EXCLUSIVE" TextAlignment="Center" Foreground="#A24F4E" FontSize="20"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
      <TextBlock TextDecorations="Underline" FontSize="20" LineHeight="26" Margin="0,0,0,18">
OPERATION CORPORATE
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,22">
FROM: CINCFLEET NORTHWOOD
    <LineBreak/>
    TO: TASK GROUP COMMANDER
    <LineBreak/>
    8 JUNE 1982
      </TextBlock>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.45" Margin="0,0,0,22"/>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
Time Zone Used Throughout the Order: ZULU.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="1. SITUATION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Commander Land Forces reports our troops ashore are making excellent progress towards Stanley. After landing of Welsh Guards at Bluff Cove on 8 June, the final attack on Stanley is proceeding. The enemy remains firmly established on the approaches to the town. Naval gunfire and air support are required to assist the final advance.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="2. MISSION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Protect the landing ships at Fitzroy and provide naval gunfire and air support to the land forces advancing on Stanley.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="3. EXECUTION:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Naval gunfire will be directed by forward observation teams from 148 (Meiktila) Commando Forward Observation Battery, Royal Artillery. Engage the designated positions as fire requests are received. Coordinate bombardment and air attacks to destroy the enemy installations obstructing the advance.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="4. THREAT:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Argentine forces are entrenched along the coast with multiple artillery batteries and AAA sites dug in. These units will be identified by shore observers. Expect low-level A-4 and Dagger attacks from the mainland. Intelligence reports indicate an improvised shore-based Exocet battery near Stanley. Its precise position has not been confirmed. Exercise particular caution when closing the coast. SA-7 shoulder-launched missiles have been reported among captured enemy equipment. Aircraft operating at low level should expect small-arms and anti-aircraft fire.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="5. SERVICE SUPPORT:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Engineers have built a FOB at San Carlos which can service SHAR and GR3s. Utilize this field to support air attacks.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run Text="6. REMARKS:" TextDecorations="Underline"/> Much has been demanded of the ships and men of this force. A further determined effort is now required. I have every confidence in your skill and resolution.
      </TextBlock>
      <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,20">
<Run>J. D. E. FIELDHOUSE</Run>
    <LineBreak/>
    Admiral, Commander-in-Chief Fleet
      </TextBlock>
      <Border Height="1" Background="#7F939E" Opacity="0.35" Margin="0,4,0,18"/>
      <TextBlock Text="SECRET / EXCLUSIVE" TextAlignment="Center" FontSize="16" Foreground="#617A8C"/>
    </StackPanel>
  </Grid>
</Border>
